{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9a51fc8d-4671-5dd3-821f-720bfd45e4b4", "source_ordinal": 1790, "reading_ordinal": 2267, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "半星之敌", "published_at": "2024-02-08T21:51:38+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/643470976/answer/3391390366"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有一说一，在哭墙面前会哭并没有那么强的意识形态意味。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这并不能作为“没有气节”“奴颜婢膝”的“铁证”。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 51}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "哭墙毕竟是人类历史的活化石，凝聚了数千年的悲欢离合，这跟xx领导人登了长城慨叹雄伟并不等于“亲中”，看了泰姬陵赞叹“精美”也不等于“亲印”，仰望胡夫金字塔的塔尖感叹日月沧桑也不能被称为“投埃”一样，会在巴黎地下墓穴里看到累累白骨为人类的命运多舛流泪也不能叫“亲法”。", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这只是具有人类正常的感情就会有的反应，有人表现的程度强烈点，也不能视为政治表态。否则按这个标准，我们就会增加很多“回国就翻脸的挚友”。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“看你在长城挺高兴的，还即兴作诗，我们还以为你是好兄弟”，难道要这样？", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 289}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "米莱亲美、亲以色列固然很明显，但是“在哭墙痛哭”属于无关紧要的细节。另外对待米莱要严肃——他终究是循游戏规则上台的一国领袖，背后有严肃的、有分量的民意。阿根廷相当一部分民众的确寄望于他的政策，指责、嘲笑他个人其实对阿根廷人民——无论我们自己是否认同ta们的选择——不够尊重。", "char_start": 290, "char_end": 427}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "尊重和是否认同是无关的。只对跟自己立场相同、利益一体的人以礼相待，对立场不同、利益不一致的人就粗鲁无礼，这种“尊重”是没有意义的。", "char_start": 428, "char_end": 493}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "尊重是可以化敌为友的利器，是能让“合作/共存”这个选项始终在对方桌上有一席之地的魔法。", "char_start": 494, "char_end": 537}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "不能化敌为友、而是将一颗星的敌人甚至半颗星都不到的、疑似敌意的他人变成死敌的这种行为方式，肯定谈不上是尊重。", "char_start": 538, "char_end": 592}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0336"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待阿根廷总统米莱在出访以色列时抱哭墙大哭？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“半星之敌”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有一说一，在哭墙面前会哭并没有那么强的意识形态意味。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有一说一，在哭墙面前会哭并没有那么强的意识形态意味。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "025010c9-a259-5d28-9ac2-4ac0fbca138a", "source_ordinal": 1789, "reading_ordinal": 2268, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "邪不压正", "published_at": "2024-02-09T01:59:37+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/641186035/answer/3391549666"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这东西要浇一下冷水——中国经济的微观不发生标志性、本质的转变，即企业治理在理论和文化上没有创造新的神话、关键科技没有出现经受市场检验的突破、交易监管没有规则性、历史性的提高，那么所有的景气都是后继乏力的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "它会呈现这样一种状态——", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "向上，涨了就会怕。涨的越多，怕的人就越多；涨到令人惊喜了，人也怕得风声鹤唳了。王婆喝水打个嗝，王勃就被倒塌的滕王阁给埋了。", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "向下，跌了就会不服气。跌得越多、越久，不服气的人就会越多——难以想象以中国的努力和积累，值不了这么多点数。越是一片唱黑、伸手不见五指的黑暗，越是有更多的人等着第一个胆大的揭竿而起。", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "在这三件事开始发生之前，恐怕这个循环会来回重复。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "现在的开放外资持股金融机构算是第三件的范畴，可回收火箭和5nm量产算是第二件之一。但这三件事中，真正能夯实大底、令其颠扑不破的，其实是第一件。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 365}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而这第一件，其实看知乎企业管理板块的讨论风气的转变是一个不错的采风窗口。", "char_start": 366, "char_end": 402}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "看它几时邪不压正。", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 412}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0336"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：1 月 25 日 A 股全线大涨，抄底资金大举进场，外资 1 小时净买入 30 亿，后市走势或将如何？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“邪不压正”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这东西要浇一下冷水——中国经济的微观不发生标志性、本质的转变，即企业治理在理论和文化上没有创造新的神话、关键科技没有出现经受市场检验的突破、交易监管没有规则性、历史性的提高，那么所有的景气都是后继乏力的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这东西要浇一下冷水——中国经济的微观不发生标志性、本质的转变，即企业治理在理论和文化上没有创造新的神话、关键科技没有出现经受市场检验的突破、交易监管没有规则性、历史性的提高，那么所有的景气都是后继乏力的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 102, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4bf98f96-a1c3-513b-9992-1241f2654321", "source_ordinal": 1788, "reading_ordinal": 2269, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "淋雨", "published_at": "2024-02-09T12:12:40+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/629406525/answer/3391797378"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "淋过雨所以想给没带伞、被偷伞、被看笑话的打伞，因为那是“我们”，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "想让那些偷我伞的、看笑话的也淋雨，因为那是“你们”。", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 59}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是绝大多数人的默认设定，而且是两者同时成立在同一个人身上，而不是一个人分属哪一类的关系。", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 105}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 3}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0336"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：导致出现“淋过雨所以想给别人打伞”和“淋过雨所以想让别人也淋雨”的差异的机制是什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003"], "summary": "围绕“淋雨”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“淋过雨所以想给没带伞、被偷伞、被看笑话的打伞，因为那是“我们”，”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "淋过雨所以想给没带伞、被偷伞、被看笑话的打伞，因为那是“我们”，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "963a3480-ff6d-5fef-8dc5-2a6f48250b01", "source_ordinal": 1787, "reading_ordinal": 2270, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "万家乐", "published_at": "2024-02-09T15:27:58+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/629088981/answer/3391925520"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "Big surprise～ 富人家庭大多数也不和睦。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "“家庭和睦”本来就是大部分家庭在少数阶段才有的状态。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 53}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "而且很多家庭不和睦的原因就在于“以为别的家庭都和睦，就自己家庭不和”，生成了一份需要人负责的罪孽盘旋在一家人头上，每日份的不和睦都要点出一个倒霉蛋来例行打板子。", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "人人都不同，不同而要和，那需要至少一方是君子——所谓“君子和而不同”。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 170}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这句话需要专门写进“君子行为守则”里，即使对君子都要天天搞个定时闹钟ding一下，何况君子难为呢。", "char_start": 171, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "家庭最和睦的时光一般就是子女会说话到懂事前那几年，学会珍惜。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "如果人人都知道“大多数家庭在大多数时候都不和睦”，知道每一个和睦的瞬间之可贵，人人知道珍惜，那么不必分析任何其他具体的原因，和睦的机会和时间反而会多一点。", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 329}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "不和睦的原因千千万万，但是“以为和睦是常态”导致的不珍惜是第一条。", "char_start": 330, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "先把这一条去掉再说。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 374}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0336"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么穷人家庭大多数都不和睦？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“万家乐”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“Big surprise～ 富人家庭大多数也不和睦。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "Big surprise～ 富人家庭大多数也不和睦。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a1f598f6-b9df-5f13-b7f5-61db2391107d", "source_ordinal": 1786, "reading_ordinal": 2271, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "傻博士", "published_at": "2024-02-09T16:07:42+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/54369673/answer/3391951001"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "博士的“傻”其实有一种共同的本质：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一般人倾向解决困扰，博士习惯性地倾向解决问题。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "解决困扰是痛苦导向的，是基于体感和直觉的。胜在理论上的“立竿见影”和“直奔主题”。", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "解决问题则涉及到归纳现象、抽象概念、厘清机制、建立方法、检验方法、得出结论这整个流程。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "其结果往往是在一个综合性的现象中找到了一个主导性的矛盾和一堆连带性矛盾。从这里博士们会兵分两路——", "char_start": 128, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一路还记得自己要干嘛，于是丢掉连带性矛盾专攻主要矛盾，从而产生了一套解决主要矛盾的、可以有效检验的系统性方法。但往往得出这个方法后就不想往后做“检验有效性”和“得出结论”这个步骤了。因为这个方法没有学术价值，实际上是对前人工作的一种应用性创新，即使市场化也没有技术壁垒。", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "另一路则从这一堆矛盾中被那些看上去最特异、最新奇的吸引，开始本能的盘算这是不是有机会做论文。", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而上述两条路线都可能指向“两眼发直、心不在焉、硬盘灯不停闪烁、散热风扇飞转”，最后却没有解决直接导致痛感的具体困扰。", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 419}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "要解决这个问题，项目业主——也就是受困扰者需要自己抽象和分解课题，然后将分解出来的课题分配给博士去解决。", "char_start": 420, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "比如让ta解决“不依赖阳光和电源的织物脱水方法”问题，而不是“买个烂房子阳台不通风、背光、还没电，我不管，以后晾衣服你负责”。", "char_start": 473, "char_end": 536}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0336"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：读博读傻是种怎样的体验？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“傻博士”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“博士的“傻”其实有一种共同的本质：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "博士的“傻”其实有一种共同的本质：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "593f8b9a-8468-54ca-a58b-7294822c8b63", "source_ordinal": 1785, "reading_ordinal": 2272, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "手心打手背", "published_at": "2024-02-09T17:05:54+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/637053291/answer/3391988520"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "其实马前卒现在发片慢，不见得是因为被强制封禁，而恐怕是因为他把自己的钢丝架得太高、拉得太细了，导致节目很难踩准这根细丝而不摔下来。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这不是官方监管造成的问题，而是ta自己不断地极化自己的定位造成的两难——他同时有两种观众，一种是真心相信他是拥护中国的，另一半则真心相信他是拥护美国的，他很难找到不激怒自己某一半观众的题材和恰当尺度，又舍不得索性放弃这部分观众。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一个形容词用得不好就要得罪一半人。而这一半人要是散了，剩下的这一半又会觉得ta说的这些其实没意思，也要跟着散。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "容错性太低，于是只好加强质检标准和环节。", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "要出一个视频自己内部就要无限地反复审、反复改，而且以前可以随便ta自由创作的某些利害相关人现在也坐不住了，也要求在发片之前要审一审。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 324}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一审二审三审，三审没过发回一审从头审。", "char_start": 325, "char_end": 344}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "当然难产了。", "char_start": 345, "char_end": 351}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "好在这种难产算是某种意义上的“饥饿营销”， 在他自己的流量上倒有所帮助。", "char_start": 352, "char_end": 388}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "问题是广告商不喜欢这种不确定性，而广告收入是很大的利润来源。", "char_start": 389, "char_end": 419}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "媒体生意不是只有新闻理念和社会理想就能一往无前的东西，它受到很多客观规律的约束，审查只是其中之一，甚至并非最关键的限制，因为专业的媒体人最清楚的就是宣传口的基本红线，能帮忙做这种合规审核的人多的是。", "char_start": 420, "char_end": 519}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "真正最麻烦的是喜怒无常的受众。", "char_start": 520, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "马前卒对受众群体的引导和计划出了大问题，弄出了“手心手背都是肉，手心手背互相要对方死，现在要逼问ta到底是哪边”这种问题。", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 597}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "他很需要一个爷叔这样的老法师。", "char_start": 598, "char_end": 613}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "问题是，他就像罗永浩一样，从一开始就是从“鄙视所有老法师”入行的。", "char_start": 614, "char_end": 647}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "现在就难办了。", "char_start": 648, "char_end": 655}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0336"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：马逆寒假何时能够结束？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“手心打手背”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“其实马前卒现在发片慢，不见得是因为被强制封禁，而恐怕是因为他把自己的钢丝架得太高、拉得太细了，导致节目很难踩准这根细丝而不摔下来。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "其实马前卒现在发片慢，不见得是因为被强制封禁，而恐怕是因为他把自己的钢丝架得太高、拉得太细了，导致节目很难踩准这根细丝而不摔下来。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 65, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "21496c63-89e3-53f5-a895-773dd7c0cde5", "source_ordinal": 1784, "reading_ordinal": 2273, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "打断腿", "published_at": "2024-02-10T10:53:16+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/643692993/answer/3392459821"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "认识到日本的亚文化是一种先天病态的东西就行了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "日本的东西你如果看得太高大，人很容易变得阴暗、扭曲和怨毒。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 53}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "乱伦冲动是日本人对自己社会的一种报复性行为，那是一种精神冻疮、自体免疫反应。", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 92}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "“重压”你的不是社会，而是自然法则，乱社会的伦，只能形成一种“反抗感”——类似吃了瘪在家打枕头砸玻璃瓶泄愤带来的快感一样。", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "解决问题是解决不了的，但是骗骗自己还是能骗一下的，毕竟人类掌管情绪的器官跟蜥蜴一个水平。", "char_start": 155, "char_end": 199}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "日本人就是这种打枕头专家，日本动漫的绝大多数——尤其是进入2000年之后，从根上讲就是这种“枕头神拳”。", "char_start": 200, "char_end": 252}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "它们推崇什么、鼓吹什么，基本上反映了一个loser的自我欺骗的最新技巧和成果。", "char_start": 253, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "可以拿来娱乐、猎奇一下，但是要怀着居高临下的俯视态度。这不是高贵民族俯视低贱民族，而是健康俯视不健康。", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 344}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "健康的高于不健康的，这是自然法则天然支持的不对等，不必为这个觉得恐慌。", "char_start": 345, "char_end": 380}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这就像肺结核病人因为虚弱无力、长期卧床，会有一种特殊的白皙感、优雅感，仿佛学过芭蕾舞，你可以欣赏，但不要羡慕，不要自己去求个肺结核“美白减肥”。", "char_start": 381, "char_end": 453}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "否则真是狗腿打断都不多。", "char_start": 454, "char_end": 466}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0336"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：总是控制不住幻想母亲怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“打断腿”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“认识到日本的亚文化是一种先天病态的东西就行了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "认识到日本的亚文化是一种先天病态的东西就行了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0f5d4861-3906-50db-928c-3d62b870a2b4", "source_ordinal": 1783, "reading_ordinal": 2274, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "睡者为王", "published_at": "2024-02-10T15:25:08+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/519282013/answer/3392629287"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么叫“必要”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不做就死了，不干就完蛋了，没有就全剧终了，此所谓“必要”。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "吃饭、睡觉这是必要的，维持最低限度的人际交往，这是必要的，掌握最基本的生存技能，这是必要的。", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "有很多东西其实是“伪必要”，是因为你有某种其实没有死不了、但你自己很看重的欲望没有它就不好实现了，只是对你的这个欲望必要，不是对你本身必要。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "比如升官发财、比如儿孙满堂、比如后宫三千——这些东西没有其实不妨碍你生存，但是你想要，于是在你的欲望不可动摇的前提下，出于欲望的最大实现——注意，这说的都不是基本实现，而是而是最大限度的实现——而出现了很多必要性。", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 264}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这包括但不限于大量的“最佳实践”。", "char_start": 265, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "最佳实践的意思是这样做最好，做不到也不是不行，只是不是“最好”而已。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 317}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "但要命的是“最好”和“欲望的最大实现”紧密相连啊。", "char_start": 318, "char_end": 343}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "正所谓一人得道，鸡犬升天，", "char_start": 344, "char_end": 357}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一念“最大”，一切“必要”。", "char_start": 358, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "转眼间“最佳实践”就变成“最低标准”了。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 393}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "一旦你采纳这种“必要观”，你就踏上了抑郁之路。", "char_start": 394, "char_end": 417}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "最佳实践刚及格，你不抑郁谁抑郁？", "char_start": 418, "char_end": 434}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "以后谈什么东西“必要不必要”，一概套一套这个公式——这是不是会影响到基本生存？如果不影响，那么这就是一种“因为想要，所以必要”的伪必要。", "char_start": 435, "char_end": 503}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "发现是伪必要，你就要坚决改口，无论对自己还是对别人，都要称其为“不必要”。", "char_start": 504, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "说到这里，你多半要感到一阵本能恐惧——恐惧自己一旦把这么多东西重新定为“不必要”自己就不会“用功”了。", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 593}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "那恰恰是因为你“必要”的圈子画得太大，以至于“必要清单”都解决不完，所以才会导致“不必要”永远被搁置。", "char_start": 594, "char_end": 645}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "那只意味着你的“必要”圈子仍然画得太大了。", "char_start": 646, "char_end": 667}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "14亿人已经很久没有饿死冻死的了，必要的圈子必然是很小的。", "char_start": 668, "char_end": 697}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你要改掉用“必要”来“逼自己努力”这种“一级致癌养生秘诀”，这跟“放血治百病”有啥区别？", "char_start": 698, "char_end": 742}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "我就是在为不必要的追求努力，咋了？见不得人？", "char_start": 743, "char_end": 765}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你以为我只是为不必要的需求努力，就比你算得慢？比你拳头轻？", "char_start": 766, "char_end": 795}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你错了，本座睡眠充足。", "char_start": 796, "char_end": 807}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "狭路相逢，睡眠充足者胜。", "char_start": 808, "char_end": 820}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "所以，没有必要联系。", "char_start": 822, "char_end": 832}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "但我想联系就联系，要你管。", "char_start": 833, "char_end": 846}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0336"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：分手了还有必要继续联系吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“睡者为王”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么叫“必要”？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么叫“必要”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
